      <itemfeedback ident="5171_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW35144725 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35144725 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="citation-1822" data-ccp-charstyle-defn="{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;962b256a-240e-5d62-80c0-0d5940a0afa2|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;citation-1822&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;citation-1822&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}"&gt; Distress refers to the negative and harmful effects of stress on the body and mind, which is the opposite of useful stress&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW35144725 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW35144725 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="4126_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW96881898 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW96881898 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Chronic stress is prolonged stress that can lead to serious health problems over time. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW96881898 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="citation-1821" data-ccp-charstyle-defn="{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;86c5ca85-e2e3-5372-bb2d-c82bf6cfa407|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;citation-1821&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;citation-1821&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}"&gt;It is not inherently useful and can be detrimental&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW96881898 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW96881898 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="8831_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW220766298 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220766298 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Acute stress is short-term stress, but this term does not specifically &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220766298 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;indicate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW220766298 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; whether the stress is useful or harmful. "Eustress" precisely defines the useful form of stress.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW220766298 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
    <item ident="gb2e80c5bc7f5fa0087eafdc036e9b041" title="Question">
