      <itemfeedback ident="3623_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW216424313 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW216424313 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="citation-1819" data-ccp-charstyle-defn="{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;7f6d8b26-7572-5936-a4d9-4f07a03f9dda|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;citation-1819&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;citation-1819&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}"&gt;Eustress is considered positive or useful stress that can enhance performance and focus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW216424313 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;. It does not describe &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW216424313 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;negative&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW216424313 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; effects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW216424313 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="7841_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW173694095 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW173694095 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Homeostasis is the body's ability to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW173694095 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;maintain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW173694095 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; a stable internal environment, a state the body tries to return to after stress. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW173694095 BCX8" data-ccp-charstyle="citation-1818" data-ccp-charstyle-defn="{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;a92a6167-3732-565d-a917-5460eb758ce3|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;citation-1818&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;citation-1818&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}"&gt;It is not a term for the negative effects of stress&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW173694095 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW173694095 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="7650_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW24594408 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW24594408 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; Adaptation is the process of adjusting to new conditions or environments. It is not a term specifically used to describe the negative health consequences of ongoing stress.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW24594408 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
    <item ident="g17e237ede0ce1ce8cdfe380ea7dcf36c" title="Question">
      <itemmetadata>
        <qtimetadata>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>multiple_choice_question</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>1.0</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
          <qtimetadatafield>
            <fieldlabel>original_answer_ids</fieldlabel>
            <fieldentry>4541,2626,7679,9443</fieldentry>
          </qtimetadatafield>
        </qtimetadata>
      </itemmetadata>
      <presentation>
        <material>
          <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW53774272 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW53774272 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;What type of stressors include events such as death, divorce, or job loss?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW53774272 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</mattext>
        </material>
        <response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single">
          <render_choice>
            <response_label ident="4541">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Circumstantial stressors</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="2626">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Physical stressors</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="7679">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Psychological stressors</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
            <response_label ident="9443">
              <material>
                <mattext texttype="text/plain">Environmental stressors</mattext>
              </material>
            </response_label>
          </render_choice>
        </response_lid>
      </presentation>
      <resprocessing>
        <outcomes>
          <decvar maxvalue="100" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal"/>
        </outcomes>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">2626</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="2626_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">7679</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="7679_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="Yes">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">9443</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <displayfeedback feedbacktype="Response" linkrefid="9443_fb"/>
        </respcondition>
        <respcondition continue="No">
          <conditionvar>
            <varequal respident="response1">4541</varequal>
          </conditionvar>
          <setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">100</setvar>
        </respcondition>
      </resprocessing>
      <itemfeedback ident="2626_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW163657904 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW163657904 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Physical stressors refer to direct demands on the body, such as extreme temperatures or strenuous exercise, not life events like death or divorce.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW163657904 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="7679_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW23305216 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW23305216 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;While death, divorce, or job loss certainly have psychological impacts, "circumstantial stressors" is the more precise term used in the content to categorize these external life events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW23305216 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="9443_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW177267730 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW177267730 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Environmental stressors are factors in the immediate surroundings, such as pollution, noise, or overcrowding, rather than significant life changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW177267730 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
    <item ident="g693895c7648a6c1bf9f1110a0570559d" title="Question">
      <itemmetadata>
