      <itemfeedback ident="3280_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW235030896 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW235030896 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Meditation typically involves focused attention or mindfulness, often on breathing or a mantra, rather than systematic tension and relaxation of muscle groups.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW235030896 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="7391_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW110348460 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW110348460 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Biofeedback is a technique that uses electronic sensors to provide real-time information about physiological processes, allowing individuals to gain conscious control over them. It is &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW110348460 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;not the same as&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW110348460 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt; systematic muscle tension and relaxation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW110348460 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="3428_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW213211811 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW213211811 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;Aerobic exercise is physical activity that raises heart rate and breathing, strengthening the cardiovascular system. While it can reduce stress, it is not defined by tensing and relaxing muscle groups.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW213211811 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
    </item>
