          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="5685_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW21636145 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW21636145 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;While depression is widespread, the specific statistic provided in the course material for the global adult population suffering from depression is 5%.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW21636145 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
      <itemfeedback ident="1319_fb">
        <flow_mat>
          <material>
            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="TextRun SCXW108619158 BCX8" lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW108619158 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;A quarter of the global adult population (25%) is too high for the prevalence of depression; this figure would suggest a much larger number than reported by health organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="EOP SCXW108619158 BCX8" data-ccp-props="{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
        </flow_mat>
      </itemfeedback>
