            <mattext texttype="text/html">&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW89945393 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;This statement is true. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW89945393 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;V&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW89945393 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;ideo gaming and technology use &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW89945393 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;can be &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun SCXW89945393 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;an &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW89945393 BCX8" data-ccp-parastyle="Normal (Web)"&gt;addiction.&lt;/span&gt;</mattext>
          </material>
